SUMMARY:Grantful Food and Fellowship Food Bank and Soup Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Grantful Food and Fellowship Food Bank and Soup Kitchen is open Fridays. Registration is required. New clients must present identification for members in their household on their first visit and annually thereafter. Time slots are handed out and clients are encouraged to arrive at the food bank the time slot they have selected. Info.: 416-690-5169
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/grantful-food-and-fellowship-food-bank-and-soup-kitchen-56/
LOCATION:Grant AME Church\, 2029 Gerrard St. E.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
